        "tvvCanisterLoad": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 50.0,
          "description": "A probe canister load Xn, in grams, chosen so that BOTH inner roots are positive and DIFFER (11.1396 and 2.8885) -- at a load where both clamp to zero the blend weight would be untested. tvvCanisterLoadClamped is the negative control at the other end. The venting chain is multiplied by an opModeFraction of exactly zero on this fixture (docs/evap-fvv.md 0.3), so its equations have no cell of MOVESOutput to be checked against; they are checked here instead, against values a reader can recompute by hand from 2.10's coefficients. Carries grams; declared unitless because these are empirical polynomials whose coefficients would need fractional inverse powers of it (docs/esm-conventions.md 11)."
        },
