          "description": "A probe load at which both inner roots are NEGATIVE (-0.4649 and -0.3816), so tvv_blend's max(0, .) is what produces the answer. Without this control the clamp would be dead text in every assertion. Carries grams; declared unitless because these are empirical polynomials whose coefficients would need fractional inverse powers of it (docs/esm-conventions.md 11)."
        },
        "tvvInnerT0Clamped": {
